MetroFuse Deezer provider, GPL-3.0-or-later.

This separate provider targets MetroFuse API 1.1.0 and the matching plugin SDK.
Build and account-screen patterns follow the MetroFuse YouTube Music reference:
https://github.com/956tris/MetroFuse-YouTube-Music

Deezer gateway request and media response shapes were inspected in deezer-py
1.3.7 and the user's dzmedia-metrofuse Rust service. This plugin implements its
own Kotlin session, catalog, Home, library and range-streaming logic. It does
not bundle or run dzmedia, deezer-py or another provider's account credentials.

All fixture identities, tokens and audio bytes are synthetic. Signed URLs,
account cookies and license tokens are kept in memory and never logged or
written to plugin settings or ordinary storage. Browser session persistence
belongs to the host's encrypted credential store.
